    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6acfd9d260d890.62054870\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\"><a data-entity=\"npc\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/npc=271604/holly-twinklebright\"><span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Holly Twinklebright</span></a> and <a data-entity=\"npc\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/npc=271366/jolli-maxiboom\"><span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Jolli Maxiboom</span></a> have updated their wares with Patch 12.1.5, and spooky season is here a bit early: Hallow's End decorations are available now!<br><br>With the addition of these vendors in Patch 12.1, we'd only seen Brewfest decor so far. Now, Hallow's End starts next week, and this shows a trend - so we'll likely see Pilgrim's Bounty and Winter Veil decor as well. A dozen new decor pieces will cost you <span class=\"moneygold\">3,350</span> for one copy of each.<br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><div class=\"decor-card-embed-wrapper\"></div>&nbsp;<div class=\"decor-card-embed-wrapper\"></div>&nbsp;<div class=\"decor-card-embed-wrapper\"></div>&nbsp;<div class=\"decor-card-embed-wrapper\"></div>&nbsp;<div class=\"decor-card-embed-wrapper\"></div>&nbsp;<div class=\"decor-card-embed-wrapper\"></div>&nbsp;<div class=\"decor-card-embed-wrapper\"></div>&nbsp;<div class=\"decor-card-embed-wrapper\"></div>&nbsp;<div class=\"decor-card-embed-wrapper\"></div>&nbsp;<div class=\"decor-card-embed-wrapper\"></div>&nbsp;<div class=\"decor-card-embed-wrapper\"></div>&nbsp;<div class=\"decor-card-embed-wrapper\"></div></div></div>\n            \n            <noscript><a href=\"/npc=271604/holly-twinklebright\">Holly Twinklebright</a> and <a href=\"/npc=271366/jolli-maxiboom\">Jolli Maxiboom</a> have updated their wares with Patch 12.1.5, and spooky season is here a bit early: Hallow's End decorations are available now!<br /><br />With the addition of these vendors in Patch 12.1, we'd only seen Brewfest decor so far. Now, Hallow's End starts next week, and this shows a trend - so we'll likely see Pilgrim's Bounty and Winter Veil decor as well. A dozen new decor pieces will cost you for one copy of each.<br /><br /><a href=\"/decor/candlelit-smiling-jack-o-lantern-26010\">Candlelit Smiling Jack-o'-Lantern</a> <a href=\"/decor/unlit-smiling-jack-o-lantern-26051\">Unlit Smiling Jack-o'-Lantern</a> <a href=\"/decor/buckled-witch-hat-26020\">Buckled Witch Hat</a> <a href=\"/decor/eternally-powered-glowskull-26018\">Eternally Powered Glowskull</a> <a href=\"/decor/enchanted-hallows-end-candle-26050\">Enchanted Hallow's End Candle</a> <a href=\"/decor/simple-hallows-end-candle-26009\">Simple Hallow's End Candle</a> <a href=\"/decor/spooky-scarecrow-26019\">Spooky Scarecrow</a> <a href=\"/decor/ominous-heartsbane-banner-26886\">Ominous Heartsbane Banner</a> <a href=\"/decor/heartsbane-candle-26889\">Heartsbane Candle</a> <a href=\"/decor/heartsbane-ritual-markings-26882\">Heartsbane Ritual Markings</a> <a href=\"/decor/heartsbane-doom-catcher-26888\">Heartsbane Doom Catcher</a> <a href=\"/decor/elaborate-heartsbane-doom-catcher-26887\">Elaborate Heartsbane Doom Catcher</a></noscript>            \n        ",
